Find BScreen::DeviceScale() in libbe's image

dlsym(RTLD_DEFAULT) does not see libbe when the client does not link it
itself (GTK): it is then only a dependency of this add-on, loaded in its
local scope, and the output scale stayed 1. Look the symbol up in the
libbe image with get_image_symbol() instead.

